cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas este software, cítalo así. / If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "humanizar-es: humanizador de texto IA en español, local y gratis"
abstract: >-
  Rewrites AI-generated Spanish text with a local base model (Qwen3-4B-Base + HIP adapter)
  and joins the sentences of each paragraph, so that Grammarly's AI detector stops flagging
  it without changing the meaning or adding errors.
authors:
